  "lorem-ipsum-generator/content/explainer.md": "# How Lorem Ipsum Generator Works\n\nThe Lorem Ipsum Generator synthesizes classic Latin placeholder text for web design mockups, wireframing, and typographic styling.\n\n## Typographic Distribution & History\nPlaceholder dummy text has been an industry standard in print publishing since the 1500s, when an unknown printer scrambled parts of Cicero's 45 BC treatise *De Finibus Bonorum et Malorum*. English text contains predictable letter pairings that distract reviewers into reading the content rather than assessing the page structure. Lorem Ipsum provides a natural distribution of letters and word lengths that emulates readable prose without conveying meaning.\n\n## Algorithmic Precision\nUnlike naive generators that append static paragraphs, our generator is built on strict grammatical rules:\n- **Strict Word Count Guarantee:** Requesting $N$ words produces exactly $N$ whitespace-delimited tokens. For example, generating 50 words produces exactly 50 words, capitalizes initial sentence clauses, and terminates with a period.\n- **Natural Sentence Rhythm:** Sentences vary in length between 5 and 15 words. For sentences longer than 8 words, a comma is inserted dynamically into the mid-sentence clause to mimic realistic phrasing pauses.\n- **Paragraph Grouping:** Paragraphs combine 3 to 7 varied sentences into structured visual blocks.\n- **HTML Export:** A dedicated toggle formats output into clean semantic `<p>...</p>` tags for immediate use in JSX or HTML templates.\n\n## Classic Opening Toggle & Workflow Utility\nDesigners frequently require the iconic *\"Lorem ipsum dolor sit amet\"* phrase to signal placeholder content instantly to stakeholders. When the \"Start with classic phrase\" option is enabled, the output begins with the traditional Latin opening clause before continuing with pseudo-random Latin vocabulary. Disabling this option shifts word offsets so text begins with varied vocabulary, ideal for testing adjacent cards or cards in a grid where identical openings look repetitive. Instant copy buttons streamline pasting directly into Figma, Sketch, or IDE editors.\n\nAll text synthesis runs entirely in your local browser with zero remote API latency.",
  "lorem-ipsum-generator/content/faqs.json": "{\n  \"schemaVersion\": 1,\n  \"items\": [\n    {\n      \"id\": \"what-is-lorem-ipsum\",\n      \"question\": \"What is Lorem Ipsum placeholder text?\",\n      \"answer\": \"Lorem Ipsum is standard dummy text used by the printing and typesetting industry since the 1500s. Derived from Cicero's philosophical treatise De Finibus Bonorum et Malorum, it mimics natural typographic word distributions.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"exact-word-count-guarantee\",\n      \"question\": \"Does requesting N words produce exactly N words?\",\n      \"answer\": \"Yes. Our generator engine strictly guarantees that selecting any word count from 1 to 500 will output exactly that count of whitespace-separated words.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"can-i-toggle-the-classic-opening\",\n      \"question\": \"Can I disable the standard \\\"Lorem ipsum dolor sit amet\\\" beginning?\",\n      \"answer\": \"Yes. A dedicated toggle switch allows you to start immediately with randomized Latin words rather than the classic opening phrase.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"html-paragraph-tags\",\n      \"question\": \"Can I export dummy text pre-wrapped in HTML paragraph tags?\",\n      \"answer\": \"Yes. Selecting the HTML output option wraps every generated block in HTML paragraph tags ready for direct insertion into web templates.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"sentence-punctuation-rules\",\n      \"question\": \"How are sentences and commas structured in the text?\",\n      \"answer\": \"Sentences range realistically between 5 and 15 words, with comma pauses inserted in clauses exceeding 8 words, capital initial letters, and terminating periods.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"word-bank-composition\",\n      \"question\": \"What words are used in the generator vocabulary?\",\n      \"answer\": \"The engine uses the authentic 70-word classic Latin corpus used in traditional typography to preserve realistic character and vowel distributions.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"why-use-lorem-over-english\",\n      \"question\": \"Why is Latin placeholder text preferable to English text in design mockups?\",\n      \"answer\": \"Latin placeholder text prevents viewers from being distracted by reading the content, focusing attention purely on visual hierarchy, font styling, and layout balance.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"paragraph-sentence-variance\",\n      \"question\": \"How many sentences are included in each paragraph?\",\n      \"answer\": \"Paragraphs randomly vary between 3 and 7 sentences, creating organic visual blocks that closely simulate authentic editorial copy.\"\n    }\n  ]\n}",
  "lorem-ipsum-generator/content/privacy.md": "## Privacy Policy for {{siteName}}\n\n**Effective Date:** {{effectiveDate}}\n\nAt {{siteName}} (available at {{domain}}), we take your privacy seriously. This Privacy Policy describes how we handle information when you visit or use {{toolName}}.\n\n## 1. Client-Side Only Processing\n\nAll computations, conversions, and data processing in {{toolName}} happen entirely within your web browser. \n\n- **No User Data Transmission:** Your inputs, values, files, or calculations are never sent to our servers or any third-party servers.\n- **No Remote Storage:** We do not collect, log, store, or transmit any data you enter into the tool.\n- **Data Retention:** Once you close or refresh your browser tab, all entered inputs and generated results are cleared from browser memory.\n\n## 2. Cookies and Local Storage\n\nThe site itself does not set or use tracking cookies.\n\n{{#if localStorage}}\n### Local Storage\nWe use browser local storage solely to remember non-identifying user interface preferences between visits. Specifically, we store the following keys:\n- `{{localStorageKeys}}`\n\nThis data remains stored locally on your device and is never transmitted to us. You can clear local storage at any time via your browser settings.\n{{/if}}\n\n{{#if ads}}\n### Advertising\nWe may display third-party advertisements to support the operation of this free utility. These advertising partners may use cookies, web beacons, or similar tracking technologies to serve ads based on your prior visits to this website or other sites on the Internet. You can manage your ad personalization settings or opt out of interest-based advertising by visiting [About Ads](https://www.aboutads.info/choices/) or [Network Advertising Initiative](https://www.networkadvertising.org/choices/).\n{{/if}}\n\n{{#if analytics}}\n### Analytics\nWe use privacy-respecting analytics to collect aggregated, anonymous traffic metrics (such as page views, referrer sources, and browser types) to understand how visitors use the site. No personal identifiers or calculation inputs are ever tracked or tied to your browsing session.\n{{/if}}\n\n## 3. Server Logging\n\nLike virtually all web hosts, the infrastructure hosting {{domain}} may record standard technical server logs. These logs may include your IP address, browser user-agent, requested URL, and access timestamps. These logs are maintained by our hosting provider for infrastructure security, DDoS mitigation, and operational integrity, and are not combined with any calculation data.\n\n## 4. Changes to This Policy\n\nWe may update this Privacy Policy from time to time. Any changes will be posted on this page with an updated effective date.\n\n## 5. Contact Us\n\nIf you have questions or concerns regarding this Privacy Policy, please contact us at:\n- **Email:** {{contactEmail}}\n- **Website:** {{domain}}\n\n",
